  "prefLabel": "Rev 1905.09 Real Estate Tax Bills",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1905.09 Real Estate Tax Bills.\n\n(a) In addition to the requirements of RSA 76:11-a, the real estate tax bill shall show the village district tax rate separately when village district tax is included on the bill.\n\n(b) The penalties imposed under RSA 74:7-a for failure to file timely and fully complete Form PA-28, “Inventory of Taxable Property”, shall be stated separately on the tax bill when such charges are included on the bill.\n\nSource. #8599, eff 4-6-06; ss by #10582, eff 5-2-14; ss by #13918, eff 3-29-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1900)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1900.html"
